# Reaction Palette + Report

::summary
The message hover palette (F-10): the 6-emoji iOS reaction set anchored to the hovered bubble, with Report Message as the danger row beneath — the App Marketplace 1.2 UGC reason flow.
::

::modal[name=react-report title="React" width=260 placement=anchored anchor=message-bubble dismissible=true]

:::toolbar
- button[label="❤️" action=reactToMessage]
- button[label="👍" action=reactToMessage]
- button[label="👎" action=reactToMessage]
- button[label="😂" action=reactToMessage]
- button[label="‼️" action=reactToMessage]
- button[label="❓" action=reactToMessage]
:::

:::row[icon=knowledge style=danger action=reportMessage href=#]
Report Message
Danger row under the emoji palette — reason flow (App Marketplace 1.2 UGC)
:::

::

Anchored to the hovered bubble; scrim-click and Esc dismiss. Picks render as count pills under the bubble, "mine" accent-tinted (state layer). Report opens the reason flow; the palette closes on pick or report.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
